<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">ADMINISTRATION</div><h1>WordPress Integration</h1><p>Connect your website and map each advisory to the right category.</p></div><span class="status-badge"><?= e($connection['connection_status']) ?></span></div><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-lg-8"><section class="surface form-panel"><h2>Connection settings</h2><p class="text-secondary">Credentials are encrypted on the server. A saved password is never displayed.</p><form method="post" autocomplete="off"><?= csrf() ?><label class="form-label" for="website_url">WordPress website URL</label><input class="form-control mb-3" id="website_url" name="website_url" type="url" value="<?= e($connection['website_url']) ?>" maxlength="500" required><label class="form-label" for="rest_url">REST API URL</label><input class="form-control mb-3" id="rest_url" name="rest_url" type="url" value="<?= e($connection['rest_url']) ?>" maxlength="500" required><div class="row"><div class="col-sm-6"><label class="form-label" for="username">WordPress username</label><input class="form-control mb-3" id="username" name="username" value="<?= e($connection['username']) ?>" maxlength="190" required></div><div class="col-sm-6"><label class="form-label" for="application_password">Application Password</label><input class="form-control mb-2" type="password" id="application_password" name="application_password" autocomplete="new-password"><div class="form-text mb-3">Leave empty to retain the saved password.</div></div></div><hr><h2>Category mapping</h2><p class="text-secondary">Enter the exact WordPress category name. Test Connection retrieves its actual ID.</p><?php foreach($mappings as $mapping): ?><label class="form-label" for="category_<?= e($mapping['module']) ?>"><?= $mapping['module']==='partial'?'Partial updates':'Scheduled interruptions' ?></label><div class="input-group mb-3"><input class="form-control" id="category_<?= e($mapping['module']) ?>" name="category_<?= e($mapping['module']) ?>" value="<?= e($mapping['category_name']) ?>" maxlength="100" required><span class="input-group-text">ID: <?= e($mapping['category_id'] ?? 'Not resolved') ?></span></div><?php endforeach; ?><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-navy" type="submit" name="action" value="save">Save settings</button></div></form></section></div><div class="col-lg-4"><section class="surface form-panel"><div class="module-icon navy-icon mb-3" aria-hidden="true">◎</div><h2>Connection status</h2><p><span class="status-badge"><?= e($connection['connection_status']) ?></span></p><p class="text-secondary">Last checked: <?= e($connection['tested_at'] ? $connection['tested_at'].' UTC':'Not yet tested') ?></p><form method="post"><?= csrf() ?><input type="hidden" name="action" value="test"><button class="btn btn-outline-secondary w-100" type="submit">Test Connection</button></form><hr><p class="small text-secondary mb-0">Tests the saved configuration with read-only API requests. Saving settings resets connection verification. Publishing remains disabled in Phase 1.</p></section></div></div>
